    "username": "godofprompt",
    "nickname": "God of Prompt",
    "text": "Claude Code can design your interface now, not just code it.\n\nyou describe a screen, it generates editable artboards, you pick one, and it builds it.\n\nit's a new /design skill from Anthropic, in research preview.\nit pulls Claude Design's artboard workflow into the Claude Code CLI https://t.co/j25xOa2ben",
