    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "godofprompt",
    "nickname": "God of Prompt",
    "text": "the catch is the brief. Claude builds the first version from your description, so a vague prompt still gives you a generic screen.\n\nknowing how to describe a UI, the layout, the components, the constraints, is the actual skill now.\n\nhere are the design prompts that get you a",
